  "body": "In https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#named-access-on-the-window-object, the `names` object is defined in step 4, but used in step 3.3.\r\n\r\nMy understanding is that it is a permanent object that is created before the steps are executed for the first time and is persisted for the next runs.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic ",
